# Portfolio specs

Before changing projects, i18n, components, or architecture, read the relevant files under `specs/`:

- `specs/architecture.md` — live vs legacy entrypoints
- `specs/editing-projects.md` — catalog + i18n split, hide flag, add checklist
- `specs/i18n.md` — locales and key paths
- `specs/showcase/{id}.md` — context for a specific project card (`id` = catalog id)

Rules of thumb:

1. Structure in `js/projects-catalog.js`; user-facing text only in `assets/i18n/{en,ar,de}.json`.
2. Keep all three locales in sync for any new/changed keys.
3. Prefer `hidden: true` over deleting private project data.
4. Do not extend legacy `js/main.js` / `assets/scripts/**` for the live site unless migrating.
